WEBVTT

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.991
What's incredible about Mongolian nomads

00:03:01.015 --> 00:03:06.343
is that the neighbors are often
40 kilometers apart,

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:10.467
and there's no private land ownership
of pasture land in Mongolia.

00:03:11.006 --> 00:03:12.332
In a way,

00:03:12.356 --> 00:03:15.879
Mongolian nomads
have the complete freedom,

00:03:15.903 --> 00:03:18.797
moving about the gorgeous
landscape as they wish.

00:03:18.821 --> 00:03:21.427
Eventually, I spotted to humble yurts

00:03:21.451 --> 00:03:23.040
and I pulled over.

00:03:23.064 --> 00:03:25.046
Yurts, or ger,

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:27.189
are a traditional Mongolian dwelling.

00:03:27.529 --> 00:03:31.224
They're made from one hundred
percent natural material,